  "sourceTitle": "Will's Extra Special Marinade",
  "sourceText": "Will's Extra Special Marinade\nBy: Homemade & Yummy\nPublished: Thursday, May 28, 2015 - 10:00am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1/4 cup olive oil\nJuice of 1/2 lemon\n1/4 cup port (use a good quality)\n2 tbsp. Worcestershire sauce\n1/2 tsp. dry mustard\n1 tsp. espresso powder\n1/2 tsp. bittersweet smoked paprika\n1/2 tsp. cocao powder\n1 tbsp. soy sauce\n2 cloves fresh minced garlic\n1/2 tsp. cracked black pepper\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all ingredients in a measuring cup. Pour over meat. Let marinate for at least 4 hour to overnight.\n\nAbout\n\nGreat marinade using port, espresso, cocao powder, smoked paprika and more. Makes steaks so tender. Great for marinating beef, bison and lamb.",
